{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ratio"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"ratio","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The contrast ratio to use"}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/init(ratio:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"init(ratio:)","externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV5ratioACSd_tcfc","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"init","roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"Defines a WCAG 2.1 ratio with the given contrast ratio value","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/init(ratio:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"ic_layers.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_layers.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png"}],"alt":null},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","u